 r←Test_YesOrNo_001(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;⎕TRAP;n
⍝ Exercise "YesOrNo" with no specific parameters; that's why this test needs a user.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 n←myGuiParms ∆YesOrNo'Are you really sure about this?'
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Dialogs.AdjustSize n
 ⎕NQ n.∆Form'KeyPress' 'EP'
 ⎕NQ n.∆Form'Close'
 ⎕DL 0.2

 r←T._OK
